// Tables that each hold the next level three times, once in place and in
// two vectors, as deep as tables nest. The C++ that tafla-gen generates from
// it compiles in a time that grows linearly with the depth, rather than in
// threes, since a table's writers are forced inline only while they're
// short. rust/gen/tests/cpp_schemas.rs keeps nesting/nesting.hpp the
// generated code.

